<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><title>Diagnostic specialise - DS</title><style>@page { size: A4; margin: 20mm 15mm; }body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.4; color: #000; }.header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px; }.header img { height: 60px; }.header h1 { font-size: 14pt; margin: 10px 0 5px 0; }.header h2 { font-size: 12pt; font-weight: normal; margin: 0; }table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 10px 0; }td, th { border: 1px solid #000; padding: 5px 8px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; }.info-table td:first-child { width: 200px; font-weight: bold; background: #f0f0f0; }.section-title { background: #4472C4; color: white; font-weight: bold; padding: 8px; font-size: 11pt; margin-top: 15px; }.sub-section { font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 8px; background: #D9E2F3; }.eldib-grid { font-size: 8pt; }.eldib-grid td { width: 25px; height: 18px; text-align: center; padding: 2px; }.eldib-grid .header-cell { background: #4472C4; color: white; font-weight: bold; }.eldib-grid .stufe-cell { background: #D9E2F3; font-weight: bold; font-size: 7pt; width: 80px; }.erreicht { background: #70AD47 !important; color: white; }.ziel { background: #FFC000 !important; color: #000; }.empty-cell { background: #E7E6E6; }.legend { margin: 10px 0; font-size: 9pt; }.legend span { display: inline-block; margin-right: 20px; }.legend-box { display: inline-block; width: 15px; height: 12px; border: 1px solid #000; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 5px; }.age-bars { margin: 15px 0; }.age-bar-row { margin: 8px 0; }.age-bar-label { display: inline-block; width: 180px; font-size: 9pt; }.age-bar-container { display: inline-block; width: 300px; height: 20px; background: #E7E6E6; border: 1px solid #999; vertical-align: middle; }.age-bar { height: 100%; display: inline-block; }.age-bar.bio { background: #5B9BD5; }.age-bar.verhalten { background: #ED7D31; }.age-bar.kommunikation { background: #5B9BD5; }.age-bar.sozialisation { background: #70AD47; }.age-bar.kognition { background: #7030A0; }.age-value { display: inline-block; width: 60px; text-align: right; font-size: 9pt; }.placeholder { color: #666; font-style: italic; }.page-break { page-break-before: always; }.copyright { font-size: 7pt; text-align: center; margin-top: 10px; color: #666; }</style></head><body><div class="header"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="CDSE"><h1>DIAGNOSTIC SPECIALISE (DS)</h1><h2>Centre pour le developpement socio-emotionnel</h2></div><div class="section-title">1. Informations generales</div><table class="info-table"><tr><td>Nom et Prenom</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Date de naissance</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Age</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Ecole/Institution</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Classe</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Date evaluation</td><td>15.1.2026</td></tr><tr><td>Evaluateur</td><td></td></tr></table><div class="section-title">2. Motif de la demande</div><table><tr><td class="placeholder">[A completer manuellement]</td></tr></table><div class="section-title">3. Anamnese</div><div class="sub-section">3.1 Developpement</div><table><tr><td class="placeholder">[A completer manuellement]</td></tr></table><div class="sub-section">3.2 Parcours scolaire</div><table><tr><td class="placeholder">[A completer manuellement]</td></tr></table><div class="sub-section">3.3 Situation familiale</div><table><tr><td class="placeholder">[A completer manuellement]</td></tr></table><div class="section-title">4. Procedure diagnostique</div><div class="sub-section">4.1 ELDiB - Entwicklungspadagogischer Lernziel-Diagnose-Bogen</div><p style="font-size: 9pt; margin: 10px 0;">Evaluation du developpement socio-emotionnel selon les domaines: Comportement (V), Communication (KOMM), Socialisation (SOZ) et Cognition (KOG).</p><div class="legend"><span><span class="legend-box erreicht"></span> Erreicht (atteint)</span><span><span class="legend-box ziel"></span> Ziel (objectif)</span><span><span class="legend-box" style="background:white;"></span> Nicht erreicht</span></div><table class="eldib-grid"><tr><td class="header-cell">V</td><td class="header-cell">KOMM</td><td class="header-cell">SOZ</td><td class="header-cell">KOG</td><td class="stufe-cell">Stufe</td></tr><tr><td class="empty-cell"></td><td class="empty-cell"></td><td class="empty-cell"></td><td class="">62</td><td class="stufe-cell">Stufe 5: 13-17 Jahre</td></tr><tr><td class="empty-cell"></td><td class="empty-cell"></td><td class="empty-cell"></td><td class="">61</td><td class="stufe-cell"></td></tr><tr><td class="empty-cell"></td><td class="empty-cell"></td><td class="empty-cell"></td><td class="">60</td><td class="stufe-cell"></td></tr><tr><td class="empty-cell"></td><td class="empty-cell"></td><td class="empty-cell"></td><td class="">59</td><td class="stufe-cell"></td></tr><tr><td class="empty-cell"></td><td class="empty-cell"></td><td class="empty-cell"></td><td class="">58</td><td class="stufe-cell"></td></tr><tr><td class="empty-cell"></td><td class="empty-cell"></td><td class="empty-cell"></td><td class="">57</td><td class="stufe-cell"></td></tr><tr><td class="empty-cell"></td><td class="empty-cell"></td><td class="empty-cell"></td><td class="">56</td><td class="stufe-cell">Stufe 4: 10-12 Jahre</td></tr><tr><td class="empty-cell"></td><td class="empty-cell"></td><td class="empty-cell"></td><td class="">55</td><td class="stufe-cell"></td></tr><tr><td class="empty-cell"></td><td class="empty-cell"></td><td class="empty-cell"></td><td class="">54</td><td class="stufe-cell"></td></tr><tr><td class="empty-cell"></td><td class="empty-cell"></td><td class="empty-cell"></td><td class="">53</td><td class="stufe-cell"></td></tr><tr><td class="empty-cell"></td><td class="empty-cell"></td><td class="empty-cell"></td><td class="">52</td><td class="stufe-cell"></td></tr><tr><td class="empty-cell"></td><td class="empty-cell"></td><td class="empty-cell"></td><td class="">51</td><td class="stufe-cell"></td></tr><tr><td class="empty-cell"></td><td cl